<title>BRAZIL: Sao Paulo Oct unemployment flat at 14.8 pct-Dieese.</title>
<headline>Sao Paulo Oct unemployment flat at 14.8 pct-Dieese.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The unemployment rate in Sao Paulo city remained steady 14.8 percent in October against the previous month, the Labor Union Statistics Institute (Dieese) reported.</p>
<p>The number of unemployed workers reached 1.266 million in October, slightly up from 1.264 million in September, it said.</p>
<p>October figures rose against the same month last year when the share of unemployed workers hit 13.4 percent of the workforce, or 1.102 million workers, it added.</p>
<p>-- Romina Nicaretta, Sao Paulo newsroom, 5511 248 5415</p>
